# Line endings are LF in the repository, on every platform.
#
# Without this, git checks files out with CRLF on Windows and Prettier's
# `format:check` fails on every text file in the repo — 409 of them, none of
# which a developer edited. The failure reads as a formatting problem and is a
# checkout artefact.
* text=auto eol=lf

# Binary, never converted.
*.png binary
*.jpg binary
*.gif binary
*.ico binary
*.woff binary
*.woff2 binary
*.tgz binary
